The offline speech model is downloaded into this folder by the GitHub Actions
build (see .github/workflows/build.yml). It is ~40 MB, which is why it is not
committed here.

Building locally in Android Studio instead? Run this once from the project root:

  curl -fSL -o model.zip https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models/vosk-model-small-en-us-0.15.zip
  unzip -q model.zip
  mv vosk-model-small-en-us-0.15/* app/src/main/assets/model-en-us/
  date +%s > app/src/main/assets/model-en-us/uuid
  rm -rf model.zip vosk-model-small-en-us-0.15
